{"ID":"20260207111751-bdk1agj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f94d","id":"20260207111751-bdk1agj","tags":"TransFormer,神经网络基础学习","title":"TransFormer","type":"doc","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260207144729-9oki8jv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-9oki8jv","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人工智能的全新范式"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"TransFormer"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-3o1rnn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-3o1rnn4","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"OK"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学了这么就也该上点强度了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"TransFromer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Goolge"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"公司于"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2017"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在论文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Attention Is All You Need"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提出的，顺便在说一句这个论文写的超级的不错，很值得仔细阅读。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-1rjpn4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-1rjpn4q","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这篇文章主要是为了解决大语言模型中的机器翻译的问题而提出的。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-yls15nt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-yls15nt","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 TransFormer是什么"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-exi37zq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-exi37zq","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"TransFormer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提出之前在人们对机器翻译这个问题上面也是耗费了不少的心血，当时最棒的网络就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"RNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"循环神经网络以及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷积神经网络(这个主要是图像处理方面的一些东西)。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-xe7t7gc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-xe7t7gc","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 TransFormer的整体架构"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-n0yfic2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-n0yfic2","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"TransFormer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是非常直接的使用了一个全局注意力机制来进行机器翻译等问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-xf52yha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-xf52yha","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"TransFormer的整体也是由很多的块儿组成的，我们可以将它理解成几个编码块儿以及几个解码块儿，加上一组输入和一组输出，就这么几个东西，当然最重要的肯定是编码块儿以及解码块儿。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-oeif33p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-oeif33p","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在进行解读。这里用一个比较简单的例子进行解读：将中文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"“我喜欢水果”"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"翻译成英文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"“I love fruits”"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-w7lbiby","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-w7lbiby","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1 TransFormer的输入部分"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-dzkl0g8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-dzkl0g8","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"TransFormer的输入部分由两个结构组成分别是词编码以及位置编码。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-b11jets","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-b11jets","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.1 词编码"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-b7bcv01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-b7bcv01","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"首先"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是词编码部分，它将一句话中的每一个单词编辑成一个所谓的词向量，每个词语都编辑成一个向量，向量的长度肯定是看自己啦。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-9r7e0d8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-9r7e0d8","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图片中表示的就是一个词语编码的例子，我们将每个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"单词"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都对应了一个1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 6的行向量，每个行向量中保存了这个词语的词义等信息。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-7dnf0u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-7dnf0u0","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260128102304946"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-image-20260128102304946-20260207144734-h2so389.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-mb6oq3f","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-mb6oq3f","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207144729-aexvhzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-aexvhzx","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里的词向量是用来保存这个单词的具体信息，虽然不知道是怎么保存的但是，就是存储成功了，词向量是通过训练得到的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-t8kf2fe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-t8kf2fe","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.2 位置编码"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-h1nftsy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-h1nftsy","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"其次"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在这么一个句子中，他和卷积神经网络是完全不一样的，卷积神经网络是存在位置信息的，但是这个词语直接切开，天知道每个词语的前后是什么。但是在翻译过程中，如果你不知道前面后面的语境，那翻译的东西真的没法看。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-e72ck93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-e72ck93","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此需要对每个单词进行位置编码操作，也就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Positional Encoding"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。编码的方式这里采用的是正余弦的编码方式。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-8xspuvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-8xspuvt","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中pos表示的是第几个单词，i就是向量中的第几个位置，d"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"{model}就是向量的整体长度，那么对于上面那个例子就可以很简单的通过这个公式来表示一下他的位置编码向量了。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-s9ry06n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-s9ry06n","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260128095708075"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-image-20260128095708075-20260207144734-imwqqng.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-f0vus2e","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-f0vus2e","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207144729-bie10m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-bie10m7","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这么一顿推导就求得了他的位置编码如下图所示。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-lzssqa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-lzssqa8","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260128102322549"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-image-20260128102322549-20260207144734-msbaf1j.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-c6o2fwf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-c6o2fwf","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.3 输入矩阵"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-op097zs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-op097zs","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在求得了词编码矩阵，以及位置编码矩阵，现在对这两个矩阵进行对应元素直接相加。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-9d5xvmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-9d5xvmm","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260128102405728"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-image-20260128102405728-20260207144734-nz598cz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-zhti0cw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-zhti0cw","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"求得编码器的输入矩阵X。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-qy3qw4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-qy3qw4i","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260128102553969"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-image-20260128102553969-20260207144734-aanrqrd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-9mpn5b8","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-9mpn5b8","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207144729-oujuikp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-oujuikp","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将词向量和位置向量直接相加，逐个元素对应相加，相加后的结果充当编码器的输入部分。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-nz86clf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-nz86clf","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在就得到了一个3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 6的输入矩阵X。便可以进入下一步，也即是编码器的部分。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-povihjp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-povihjp","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2 TransFormer的编码器"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-2v56tda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-2v56tda","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"编码器的主要结构就是下面这个结构，主要包括了一个多头注意力模块，一个前馈函数模块，两个残差连接归一化模块。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-n181g44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-n181g44","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260128101428793"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-image-20260128101428793-20260207144734-ce8jp37.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-ob3iuup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-ob3iuup","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先输入数据进入多头注意力机制模块，进行处理。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-xo0nibx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-xo0nibx","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.1 自注意力机制模块"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-kczzdcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-kczzdcz","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多头注意力机制模块的框图如下所示，其中的各种详情会逐步叙述"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-bnudccj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-bnudccj","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260128101710148"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-image-20260128101710148-20260207144734-kufymw6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-sj5pyma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-sj5pyma","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"包括了位置信息以及词语本身信息的3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 6大小的输入矩阵X输入到了多头注意力机制模块，其中多头注意力机制模块是三个单头注意力机制模块的合成体。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-8wbx9kw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-8wbx9kw","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.1.1 单头注意力机制"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-1oicnhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-1oicnhp","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先对单头注意力机制模块进行讲解，假设单头注意力机制模块的输入为3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 2大小的矩阵X"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"i，现在天生存在三个大小完全相同的矩阵分别是W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q,W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"K,W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"V这三个矩阵的大小均为2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 2，同时这三个矩阵分别对X做线性变换，一定是列变换而非行变换，不能把每个单词搞混了。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-xe7srjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-xe7srjr","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"left"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"{ "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"begin{array}{l} {{"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"rm{X}}"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"{iQ}} "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" {X"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"i} "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times {W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q}"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span\\","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" {{"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"rm{X}}"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"{iK}} "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" {X"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"i} "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times {W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"K}"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span\\","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" {{"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"rm{X}}"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"{iV}} "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" {X"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"i} "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times {W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"V} "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"end{array} "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"right."}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-1vgl5br","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-1vgl5br","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这之后得到的三个矩阵一定是大小相等的三个矩阵，他们的大小均是3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 2和原来保持不变。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-eodk7rv","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-eodk7rv","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207144729-6bjag5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-6bjag5n","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个线性变换的三个W矩阵均是通过深度学习的过程之中学习得到的数据，每个矩阵的数据都是先随机初始化，然后反向传播学习出来的，并非一开始就给定的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-3iuesyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-3iuesyc","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而这三个得到的矩阵分别就对应了单头注意力的三个输入矩阵Q，K，V。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-891hcwv","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-891hcwv","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207144729-0rq0en5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-0rq0en5","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在对这三个矩阵进行一些通俗的理解，也是用一个例子来说明一下，比方说这个单头注意力输入的单词是\"水\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-hw8y87z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-hw8y87z","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么Q也就是Query，好比是一个提问的试卷，它上面包含了很多问题，他会问道\"你是不是物体？你是不是吃的？你是不是喝的？\"这些问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-i03pj1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-i03pj1z","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而K也就是Key，好比是一个回答的关键词，当Q问道“你是不是吃的？”这个时候Key就是回答“yes或者no”。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-iqczrys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-iqczrys","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而V也就是Value，就非常基本的表示这个的具体数据。没啥好说的"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-9wx7m3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-9wx7m3f","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有了这三个矩阵之后便进入倒第一个操作也就是Q和K之间相关性质的判定了，这个判定非常简单，就是矩阵相乘向量内积的感觉。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-f9fq95i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-f9fq95i","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"number "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" QK"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"^"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"T"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-z0uqc32","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-z0uqc32","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207144729-oukgeem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-oukgeem","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还是一样用上面的那个例子说一下，如果我的输入是水，并且Q发问“你是不是吃的？”这个时候Key就是回答“yes”，那么数据会较低一些，反之则反之。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-7dc872l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-7dc872l","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Q和K均是一个3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 2大小的矩阵，那么经过转职后相乘，他的结果就是一个3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 3大小的矩阵。这个矩阵里面就包含了这两个矩阵相似度的信息。而这个事情就是进行一个打分看看水究竟和那种类型的意思更加的接近一些。用下面的矩阵可能会很好理解。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-wdqt8qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-wdqt8qt","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260128105415340"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/network-asset-image-20260128105415340-20260207144734-valdjzw.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-b1gewvz","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-b1gewvz","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207144729-ufyloxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-ufyloxk","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"矩阵搞定之后得到的结果可以说是一个分数罢了，分数越高越匹配，当然实际的TransFormer的东西肯定不仅仅只有这么一些东西，它是更加的多维度发问"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-9pvnd4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-9pvnd4s","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是分数这么高在进行学习的过程中非常容易出现问题，尤其是在归一化的时候，人们发现，K的维度大小会十分显著的影响分数的高低，因此需要对这个矩阵进行缩放，那么缩放的方法也是超级简单的，直接除以"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"sqrt{"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"rm{dK}}即可实现效果比较好的缩放。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-jo0zx5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-jo0zx5o","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么现在他的公式就发生了第二次演化。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-s4pn324","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-s4pn324","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"number "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"frac{QK"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"^"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"T}{"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"sqrt{dK}}"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-kisai00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-kisai00","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样子就实现了缩放以及基本的寻找，但是这个缩放后的东西直接放进原本的网络模型中进行训练，数据肯定是不对的，必须要进行一下归一化的操作，因此这里对每一行，也就是每一个K都进行Softmax操作，实现归一化"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-d2w78vf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-d2w78vf","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"number "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Softmax("},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"frac{QK"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"^"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"T}{"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"sqrt{dK}})"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-fkqj80l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-fkqj80l","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这之后就可以放进网络之中进行训练，最后在将原本的所表示的具体数据Vlaue放进来就实现了整整的单头注意力的全部实现。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-t0pyuk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-t0pyuk1","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Attention "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Softmax("},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"frac{QK"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"^"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"T}{"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"sqrt{dK}})V"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-gzz5lt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-gzz5lt2","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很巧合的最后的输出矩阵还是和输入矩阵相同的维度，也是3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 2大小的一个矩阵。那么至此单头注意力就实现成功了。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-tvf2yw1","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-tvf2yw1","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207144729-lo2aoxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-lo2aoxc","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单头注意力机制的整体思路和之前的注意力机制思路基本一致，首先求解出每个意思对应的权重大小，然后再将这个权重大小和真正的意思相乘，求得权重最大的那个意思即可。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-lm403ic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-lm403ic","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么为什么会引入多头注意力机制呢？这究竟是什么东西？相较于单头注意力机制效果涨了几何？"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-bhfd5pe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-bhfd5pe","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.1.2 多头注意力机制模块"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-d8h3iuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-d8h3iuh","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单头注意力很好，但是它仅仅也只是一个人呀，真所谓三个臭皮匠顶的过一个诸葛亮。因此团队是非常重要的，考虑到这个因素，便发明了多头注意力机制，作者希望每个头都专攻一个方向。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-g4byk6g","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-g4byk6g","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207144729-j0o6rhq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-j0o6rhq","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有的头主要是对名词这块进行处理，有的头主要处理形容词，等等。这么多头处理完毕之后再合成，实现比较好的效果。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-i0ksj96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-i0ksj96","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在就用之前的我喜欢水果一例来说一说什么是多头注意力机制模块吧。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-als5btj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-als5btj","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前再输入部分已经确定了，咱们的输入矩阵是一个带着位置信息和词语信息的一个3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 6大小的矩阵。那么多头多头，首先肯定要先分开各自输入到每个头之内把，因此这里使用的也是一个基本的线性变换，我们由三个矩阵分别是W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1,W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2，W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3这三个矩阵的大小完全相同均是6"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 2大小的矩阵。那么用这三个矩阵对数据矩阵进行线性列变换就得到了三个注意力头的输入矩阵X"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1,X"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2,X"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3了，这里每个X"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"i的大小都是3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times 2的。"}]},{"ID":"20260207144729-nidfcms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207144729-nidfcms","updated":"20260207144729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"left"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"{ "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"begin{array}{l} {X"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1} "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" X "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\\"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"times {W"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1}"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"